      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SO SI GOD (3) trialled well coming into her fresh run but got her tongue over the bit and disappointed as the race favourite in Saturday grade. The gear changes should help and Riordan's claim comes in handy. Better for that run and the form has been franked. Can bounce back in a big way. GUARANTOR (4) can go on with the fresh run after a 0.5L victory at this track and trip. Things look to set up nicely for him here and now Chris Parnham hops on board. Ticks plenty of boxes and he's a second-up winner in the past. Can go on with the job. HEZ GOT THE SAFE (1) building nicely into the campaign, missing by 1.9L at this track and trip last time out. This shapes nicely and while he hasn't won for a while, he's knocking on the door. Can play a leading role off the inside. JOYOH (5) can feature in the finish first-up. ON CUE (2) disappointed last start but was better prior to that. Back in trip now and he can bounce back.",
